Iran is preparing 14 oil tankers to challenge the US naval blockade, Iranian lawmaker Vahid Ahmadi told the news outlet Khabar Fori. He threatened retaliation against oil facilities across the region if any of the vessels came under attack.

“If we cannot sell oil, others should not be able to sell it either,” said Ahmadi, a member of parliament’s National Security Committee. 
